sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Administrator
    actor S as Student
    participant B as Web Browser
    participant Srv as Express Server
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    participant FS as File Storage

    Note over A,FS: Upload Flow
    A->>B: Fill upload form and submit file
    B->>Srv: POST /upload (multipart form)
    Srv->>Srv: Validate session (admin only)
    Srv->>FS: Save file to /uploads
    Srv->>DB: INSERT resource metadata
    DB-->>Srv: Success
    Srv-->>B: Redirect to dashboard + success message
    B-->>A: Show updated resource list

    Note over S,FS: Search and Download Flow
    S->>B: Enter search keyword / select category
    B->>Srv: GET /dashboard?q=...&category=...
    Srv->>DB: SELECT resources WHERE title/course LIKE ?
    DB-->>Srv: Matching resource rows
    Srv-->>B: Render filtered resource list
    S->>B: Click Download
    B->>Srv: GET /resources/:id/download
    Srv->>DB: INSERT download log
    Srv->>FS: Read file
    FS-->>Srv: File stream
    Srv-->>B: Deliver file to browser
    B-->>S: File saved to device
